[33.055931, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ diag.event appends to the buffer \u001b[90m(2.929834ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ diag.event silently ignores unknown levels \u001b[90m(0.372875ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ diag.event enforces 50-event buffer with FIFO eviction \u001b[90m(0.409041ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ diag.event drops undefined field values \u001b[90m(0.308125ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ diag.event stringifies non-string field values \u001b[90m(0.255833ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ diag.event drops fields with overlong keys \u001b[90m(0.833958ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ diag.setContext merges into subsequent events \u001b[90m(0.267667ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ diag.env returns the expected iOS-Safari-pertinent fields \u001b[90m(0.29375ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ diag.env handles missing navigator.connection gracefully \u001b[90m(0.499333ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ diag.flush sends via sendBeacon when document is hidden \u001b[90m(0.547458ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ diag.flush uses fetch({keepalive:true}) when visible \u001b[90m(5.890583ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ diag.flush clears the buffer on success \u001b[90m(0.441125ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m"]
